{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的S08只有20秒，却连续呈现多组未标记时出现的感受词，扫读负担明显高于Y；而且“却没想回头”比Y的“暂时把回不回去的事放到一边”更早替人物下了结论，削弱了犹疑感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮短语先给出每段叙事的抓手，再把较小的感受词贴着叙事和音乐进程展开，普通观众更容易知道眼下该看什么、情绪为何转弯；到时出现的提示也让音乐变化有了具体的时间位置。两版人物动机的文字本身相当接近，Y个别地方（如S09想要有人陪）甚至更直白，但X对音乐质感、动作、情绪转折的描写更细腻具体，整体视听对应也更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "287a5ea8-a3e3-4dd4-86ce-ecb2da0cb894", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231452794318Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:16:14.932940+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e0411f917f8a23a060b938ea1b3c0eae3d2d369fcedf513bdbbd18602849b030", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w